{"ts":"2026-07-10T10:48:01.400Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"Observed live 2026-07-10: `pm activity --from <ts> --compact --json` returns an envelope containing BOTH `\"activity\": []` (always empty in compact mode) and `\"compact_activity\": [...]` (the real rows). Two defects: (1) token waste — a constant dead key ships on every compact query, contrary to the lean-output direction (GH-435 pm-cfed, GH-437 pm-nilh); (2) agent-shape trap — an agent probing `.activity` (or `.entries`) sees a plausible empty array and concludes \"no activity\" instead of erroring, a silent-wrong-answer class worse than a missing key. Fix direction: compact mode should emit ONE canonical key (either reuse `activity` for the compact rows, or omit the empty array entirely); apply the same single-key rule to the MCP pm_run activity envelope and document the shape in contracts. Related: pm-cfed (lean JSON), pm-nilh (lean default), closed pm-ne67 (introduced --compact)."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-p3x4"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"pm activity --compact --json emits an empty activity:[] decoy key alongside compact_activity"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","cli","token-efficiency"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-10T10:48:01.400Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-10T10:48:01.400Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":60},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"compact --json emits exactly one activity key (no empty decoy array); MCP activity envelope matches; contracts/docs state the compact JSON shape; regression test asserts the empty key is absent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-mpbb"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"low"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-cfed","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-10T10:48:01.400Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"b8533bb532d474621c145af9ab2399039f245debef7a33682eb9cd0a6530ef0f","message":""}
